     "titulo": "Modality and agent",
     "texto": [
      "Compare **skal**, **må**, **bør** and **kan** in context, rather than through absolute equivalences. Passive and impersonal forms can hide who carries out an action. Ask whether the text states a requirement, a recommendation or an option, and for whom."
